'' 'field = N' on a type inside an extern block is honoured, not read with the block's
'' linkage bits as a packing of 33.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-udt tests/types/src/extern-block-field.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: a size 12 align 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: a off p 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: b size 6 align 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: b off p 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: c size 12 align 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: c off p 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: d size 20 align 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: d off q 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: d off s 12
